/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
/* OceanScope 3D — mock ocean data engine                              */
/*                                                                     */
/* All values are generated by deterministic, seeded functions so the  */
/* prototype behaves like a stable scientific dataset: the same        */
/* filters always return the same numbers. Replace these functions     */
/* with FastAPI calls later (see src/services/api.ts).                 */
/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */

